**Khegh Madul** (/' *kɛx mɑdul* /, [[khegh-madul|Khegh Madul]]: *ᠺᠧᠬ ᠮᠠᠳᠦᠯ*) is a language spoken in the area of [[khegh-yaen|Khegh Yaen]] and [[xoseon-steppes|Xoseon Steppes]]. The name comes from the manuscript from which it was rediscovered, speaking of the kingdom of Khegh Madul, and was misinterpreted as the name of the language.
